### -----------------------------
### User endpoints
### -----------------------------

### Register user (valid)
POST {{apiUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Register user (invalid - validation)
POST {{apiUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": "",
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "password": "123"
}

### Register user (duplicate - should return 409)
POST {{apiUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login (get JWT token)
POST {{apiUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### NOTE: After successful login, copy the token from the response and set @token variable at top of this file.

### -----------------------------
### Product endpoints
### -----------------------------

### Get all products (public)
GET {{apiUrl}}/products

### Get product by id (public)
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/1

### Create product (protected - requires JWT)
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "iPhone 15",
    "description": "Latest Apple smartphone",
    "image_url": "https://example.com/iphone15.jpg",
    "price": 999.99,
    "quantity": 50
}

### Create product without token (should return 403)
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "NoAuth Phone",
    "description": "Should fail",
    "image_url": "https://example.com/noauth.jpg",
    "price": 1.99,
    "quantity": 1
}

### -----------------------------
### Cart / Checkout endpoints
### -----------------------------

### Checkout (protected - requires JWT)
POST {{apiUrl}}/cart/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "items": [
        { "product_id": 2, "quantity": 2 }
    ],
    "address": "123 Main St, City"
}

### Checkout without token (should return 403)
POST {{apiUrl}}/cart/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 2 }
    ],
    "address": "123 Main St, City"
}

### -----------------------------
### Error & edge-case tests
### -----------------------------

### Get product invalid id (400 expected)
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/invalid-id

### Login with wrong credentials (401 expected)
POST {{apiUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### End of tests